# Snapshot baselines are compared byte-for-byte against text the tool generates
# fresh, which always uses LF. This repo is used with core.autocrlf=true, which
# would rewrite them to CRLF on checkout — and every fixture would then report
# drift on a clean clone, with no engine change behind it.
#
# tests/tools/snapshot.mjs also normalises line endings when it reads a
# baseline, so a stray CRLF cannot break the check. This attribute is the fix;
# that normalisation is the seatbelt.
tests/baselines/*.snap text eol=lf
tests/baselines/README.md text eol=lf
